      weight: 49.5
      texts:
      - language: en
        text: You must build a hatchery to feed your minions.
      clips:
      - language: en
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c779da11b8a185d4ba18256ed2f5a2bd, type: 3}
    - variant: Rare
      weight: 1
      texts:
      - language: en
        text: Would you survive without food? Build a hatchery!
      clips:
      - language: en
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 67514c38292d835449b2e1f972d961d6, type: 3}
  - id: HatcheryTooSmall
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 30
    lines:
    - variant: 1
      weight: 49.5
      texts:
      - language: en
        text: Your hatchery is too small.
      clips:
      - language: en
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 916523abc8cdfa643a92db605b72ffba, type: 3}
    - variant: 2
      weight: 49.5
      texts:
      - language: en
        text: Food has been exhausted, enlarge your hatchery.
      clips:
      - language: en
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b66c51bc913b43e478141cbd9294dc52, type: 3}
    - variant: Rare
      weight: 1
      texts:
      - language: en
        text: Freerange is spacially inefficient, expand your hatchery or abandon
